Conv 46812: „ჩემს ნაცნობებში პირდაპირ ფოტოგრაფი არ აღმოჩნდა … (ის ჩემი ქსელის
წევრია)" — Netai spoke as the owner. Netai has no contacts or network of its
own, so in the plan reply „my" before contacts / network / circle is turned to
„your" (ka, en, es, ru). Quoted words are left alone; other first-person
words are untouched. Runs only on a reply that asks for approval. A server
rewrite of the reply; no prompt or tool text changes.

